---
import BaseLayout from '../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout title="About" lang="en">
  <div class="about container">
    <h1>About SimuLearn</h1>

    <section class="about-section">
      <h2>What is this?</h2>
      <p>
        SimuLearn is a long-term engineering knowledge system. It starts from
        <strong>structural simulation and FEA</strong>, then expands into thermal, fluids,
        multiphysics coupling, chip package reliability, electronic cooling, and eventually device/process TCAD.
      </p>
    </section>

    <section class="about-section">
      <h2>Why this site?</h2>
      <p>
        Simulation experience is easily reduced to screenshots and click sequences. This site preserves what matters:
        why a model was chosen, which assumptions limit it, how the result was verified, and why failed branches failed.
      </p>
    </section>

    <section class="about-section">
      <h2>Content Focus</h2>
      <ul>
        <li><strong>Knowledge paths</strong>: theory, modeling, verification, cases, diagnostics, and tools</li>
        <li><strong>Engineering cases</strong>: assumptions, settings, evidence boundaries, and postmortems</li>
        <li><strong>Diagnostics</strong>: structured symptom-to-root-cause reasoning</li>
        <li><strong>Public roadmap</strong>: practiced, learning, and planned work are labeled separately</li>
      </ul>
    </section>

    <section class="about-section">
      <h2>Tech Stack</h2>
      <p>
        The full knowledge base is maintained in Chinese. English covers the core positioning and selected
        high-value cases and tools. The site is built with <a href="https://astro.build" target="_blank">Astro</a>
        and deployed on Cloudflare Workers.
      </p>
    </section>

    <section class="about-section">
      <h2>Source</h2>
      <p>
        The website source is public. Engineering cases are sanitized before publication.
      </p>
      <a class="btn" href="https://github.com/xiaoluobo1234/simulearn-site" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer">
        View GitHub repository ↗
      </a>
    </section>
  </div>
</BaseLayout>

<style>
  .about { max-width: var(--max-width); }
  .about h1 { margin-top: 0; font-size: 2rem; margin-bottom: var(--space-2xl); }
  .about-section { margin-bottom: var(--space-2xl); }
  .about-section h2 { font-size: 1.375rem; border: none; padding: 0; margin-bottom: var(--space-md); }
</style>
